Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: geome
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: approximate public IP-based geolocation command
 Query an external HTTPS IP-geolocation service and display the apparent
 public location as compact text, city, coordinates, JSON, or labeled fields.
 Results are approximate and can reflect VPN, proxy, or gateway locations.
 No root privileges, configuration files, or local network discovery are used.
